[{"answer":"First of all I'd just like to say, Cristina and Ibrahim,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/1.mp3"},{"answer":"that I really enjoyed watching your video about student life last week,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/2.mp3"},{"answer":"and I could see that the rest of the group did too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/3.mp3"},{"answer":"You did really well, and I hope that you got a lot out of it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/4.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd like to use this tutorial as a feedback session,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/5.mp3"},{"answer":"where you reflect on the experience of doing the project.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/6.mp3"},{"answer":"So Cristina, I was wondering, what did you enjoy most about making the video?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/7.mp3"},{"answer":"I liked using the camera.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Is it the first time you've operated one like that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it is.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Well the results were very good!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Anything else?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/12.mp3"},{"answer":"I also enjoyed visiting one of the British students we filmed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/13.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd never been inside a British home before.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay Cristina, thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/15.mp3"},{"answer":"What about you, Ibrahim?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/16.mp3"},{"answer":"What did you enjoy?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, for me it was a very good chance to get to know students who are on other courses,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/18.mp3"},{"answer":"because everyone in our group is studying English, and...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/19.mp3"},{"answer":"we don't usually have much to do with the rest of the college.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you think you'll maintain the contact now?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I hope so.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I've invited three of them to have dinner with me next week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Great!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/25.mp3"},{"answer":"If you haven't decided what to make yet, I can tell you they'll love trying Arab dishes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/26.mp3"},{"answer":"And of course, it's good for your English too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Cristina, what did you find?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/28.mp3"},{"answer":"What was the most useful aspect of the project from the point of view of the English practice?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/29.mp3"},{"answer":"I think, when we were being shown how to edit the film,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/30.mp3"},{"answer":"we had to follow the instructions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/31.mp3"},{"answer":"And that was very good practice for me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/32.mp3"},{"answer":"And I also learned some technical words that I hadn't heard before.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/33.mp3"},{"answer":"What about you Ibrahim?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/34.mp3"},{"answer":"What was the most useful for your English?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/35.mp3"},{"answer":"It was listening to the British students,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/36.mp3"},{"answer":"because they don't speak as slowly as most of the tutors on our course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/37.mp3"},{"answer":"I think they speak at natural speed,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/38.mp3"},{"answer":"so it forces me to get used to it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/39.mp3"},{"answer":"And they use a lot of slang.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/40.mp3"},{"answer":"So you learned some new words which will be useful?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/43.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm glad it helped.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, we've talked a little bit about enjoyment, and about language practice.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Were there any other benefits?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/46.mp3"},{"answer":"What else did you feel you'd learnt from the project?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Was it useful in other ways?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, well firstly, I learned how to use a video camera.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/49.mp3"},{"answer":"And also, I think I really learned a lot about working together with other people.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/50.mp3"},{"answer":"I've never done anything with a group before,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/51.mp3"},{"answer":"and we had to find ways of cooperating,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/52.mp3"},{"answer":"erm, and compromising,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/53.mp3"},{"answer":"and sometimes persuading people, when they don't agree with you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that is a very useful experience, I know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/55.mp3"},{"answer":"What about you, Ibrahim?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I think I learnt a lot about how important editing is.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/57.mp3"},{"answer":"When you're filming, you think that everything's going to be interesting,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/58.mp3"},{"answer":"but in fact we cut around half of it in the end,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/59.mp3"},{"answer":"and then it was much better.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, one last thing I'd like to ask.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/62.mp3"},{"answer":"What mistakes do you think you, as a group that is, made?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/63.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean, to put it another way, if you had to do it all over again,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/64.mp3"},{"answer":"is there anything you'd do differently?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/65.mp3"},{"answer":"We didn't plan very well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/66.mp3"},{"answer":"For example, we didn't decide on dates when we'd complete each separate step of the project,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/67.mp3"},{"answer":"and we should have agreed about that in the beginning,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/68.mp3"},{"answer":"because we were always late with everything!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Anything else?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/71.mp3"},{"answer":"I think we should have tried to experiment more with the camera.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/72.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean with angles, and the focus and that kind of thing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/73.mp3"},{"answer":"So you should have been more ambitious?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you agree, Ibrahim?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Not really.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/76.mp3"},{"answer":"In fact, I think we were too ambitious.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/77.mp3"},{"answer":"We were inexperienced, and we didn't have a lot of time,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/78.mp3"},{"answer":"and we tried to do too much, to make a long film.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/79.mp3"},{"answer":"Next time I would make a shorter one and try to get the quality better.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/80.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, that's very interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/81.mp3"},{"answer":"Next semester we will be doing another video project - with a different content, of course -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/82.mp3"},{"answer":"but you'll have an opportunity to put into practice what you've learnt this time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/83.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you have any ideas about...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-3-2023-08-05-19-32-53/84.mp3"}]
